    rdfs:label "Reservation: Direct confirmation states" ;
    rdfs:comment "States of the Direct confirmation path of the Reservation workflow, in order: ReservationPending, ReservationConfirmed. A transition is legal between adjacent states. A reservation's status per schema.org ReservationStatusType: pending, on hold, confirmed, cancelled." ;
